flowchart TD
    A[Approved Repository Instructions] --> B[Lead Agent]
    B --> C[Developer Agent]
    C --> D[Reviewer Agent]
    D --> E[Validator Agent]
    E --> F[Deterministic Gates]
    F --> G{All Requirements Satisfied?}
    G -- No --> H[Failure Evidence and Correction]
    H --> C
    G -- Yes --> I[Evaluator Agent]
    I --> J[Human Approval]
